 :itonami.blueprint/coverage-note
 "The third CHN member of the municipality family, after -chn-beijing and
 -chn-shanghai. Its point is that Shenzhen legislates under TWO instruments
 and the catalog holds one of each: a 经济特区法规 (SEZ regulation, effective
 without provincial approval) and a 地方性法规 whose own announcement records
 GUANGDONG PROVINCIAL approval (2020-06-23) between municipal passage
 (2019-12-31) and effect (2020-09-01) — a step the 直辖市 siblings do not
 have. The culture catalog is deliberately small (3 entries, no dish/
 festival/craft): a 45-year-old city, with two Ming-era walled towns inside
 its boundary. Candidates whose sources did not tie them to Shenzhen were
 dropped, not padded in."}
